@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title UC10: Deliver an Order - Activity Diagram
start
:Shipper receives delivery assignment notification;
:Shipper accepts delivery task and navigates to Hub dispatch counter;
:Shipper scans package QR code at hub counter;
:System verifies package match and marks order 'Out for Delivery';
:Customer receives live GPS courier tracking;
:Shipper arrives at customer delivery location;
if (Customer available to receive?) then (yes)
  if (Payment is COD?) then (yes)
    :Collect cash on delivery and confirm amount;
  else (Prepaid)
  endif
  :Capture proof of delivery photo;
  :Mark order 'Delivered';
  :System sends electronic receipt and satisfaction rating prompt;
else (no)
  :Attempt phone contact 3 times;
  :Wait out mandatory 10-minute timeout;
  :Mark order 'Failed Delivery' with GPS timestamp;
  :Return package to hub storage;
endif
stop
@enduml
